SCOPE

This license covers the code, prompts, card library, synthetic task generators,
synthetic binaries, analysis scripts, recorded traces, and repository-authored
documentation and metadata included in this artifact.

Third-party public CTF binaries used for the exploratory evaluation are NOT
included in this repository and are not covered by this license.
`harness/tasks/real/` contains only repository-authored documentation/metadata
and SHA-256 identifiers for those external artifacts. Any third-party challenge
files obtained independently remain subject to the terms set by their original
authors and distributors. See `harness/tasks/real/README.md`.
